{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 37396, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 31772, "uid": 57, "type": 4, "title": "装备加工系统", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1591776142, "updated_at": 1653700797, "updated_uid": 15803, "comment_at": 1605808423, "last_at": 1660998797, "comment_count": 6, "status": 1, "summary": "装备加工系统可在装备(武器、防具、装饰品)上镶嵌额外的特殊能力，大大提升装备的战力!额外的特殊能力包括\"攻击力增加\"、使用SlideSkill攻击时伤害增加、攻击时部分伤害吸收为HP等多种是否为二级目", "thumb": "//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b8b/7_18cUd018bng58kzn303jk1i_bl240p.jpg?type=w660,//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323bf7/8_78cUd018bngehdp31ray4z6_kj3gfd.jpg?type=w660,//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b48/9_i8cUd018bng1fu6luwyr92to_2ijcxc.jpg?type=w660", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 13, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 34142, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 5, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 37396, "content": "<div data-reset=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">装备加工系统可在装备(武器、防具、装饰品)上镶嵌额外的特殊能力，大大提升装备的战力! 额外的特殊能力包括\"攻击力增加\"、使用Slide Skill攻击时伤害增加、攻击时部分伤害吸收为HP等多种</span><br></div><div data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"需要素材\">\n        <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n        <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n    </div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">欲进行加工时，您的装备需要至少强化至+5以上，以及准备下列的强化工艺石</span><br></div></div><div data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</div><div data-reset=\"true\">- 工艺石</div><div data-reset=\"true\">分为武器、防具、装饰品等3种。用来在装备上镶嵌特殊能力。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b8b/7_18cUd018bng58kzn303jk1i_bl240p.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">※ 工艺石取得办法</div><div data-reset=\"true\">① 在活动奖励取得，以及商店中购买</div><div data-reset=\"true\">② 使用\"怪奇矿石\"和装备加工道具打造</div><div data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</div><div data-reset=\"true\">- 打造工艺石的方法</div><div data-reset=\"true\">加工道具分为武器、防具、装饰品等3种，使用\"怪奇矿石\"和不同的加工道具打造工艺石后，即可获得与加工道具相同类型的工艺石。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323bf7/8_78cUd018bngehdp31ray4z6_kj3gfd.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">您可在装备分页中的\"打造工艺石\"画面中进行打造工艺石制作。选择欲打造的工艺石种类及数量(+、-)后，点击按钮即可打造工艺石。</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b48/9_i8cUd018bng1fu6luwyr92to_2ijcxc.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\">- 强化后的装备</div><div data-reset=\"true\">欲进行镶嵌加工，您的装备需要至少强化至+5以上</div><div data-reset=\"true\">镶嵌加工栏位在强化+5 / +10/ +15各开放一个栏位</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323bg2/b_a8cUd018bng1re5ryzw5jm9e_7po96r.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"装备加工方法\">\n        <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n        <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n    </div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323bh2/d_98cUd018bng14qijyynvu3w8_otwvio.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br></div></div><div data-reset=\"true\">※ 使用连续镶嵌功能。可指定连续加工直到获得指定等级的能力，或素材消耗完毕</div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b77/g_b8cUd018bngy8yawszglpgp_czityi.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"能力继承\">\n        <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n        <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n    </div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">镶嵌的能力可继承(转移)至其他的装备上，能力限转移至相同的栏位中。欲接受转移的装备该栏位必须围启用状态</span><br></div></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-v-0715c7a7=\"\" src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b0e/i_08cUd018bng1wvkorxjxq2dx_dlna29.jpg?type=w660\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-reset=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 35, 47);\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><br></div><div data-reset=\"true\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"特殊能力的种类和机率\">\n        <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n        <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n    </div><div style=\"min-height:20px;\" class=\"min-height-wrapper\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">加工时出现特殊能力的种类和机率，在不同的装备类型和栏位皆有差异。</span><br></div></div><div data-reset=\"true\">分为E ~ S等级，根据机率出现不同等级的能力。</div><div data-reset=\"true\">不同等级出现的机率表如下</div><div data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</div><div data-reset=\"true\">特殊能力机率表</div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1592046939164_70044396.png\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-upload=\"true\"></section><div data-reset=\"true\" id=\"true\"><br></div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1592046926995_94018561.png\" alt=\"装备加工系统\" data-upload=\"true\"></section><div data-reset=\"true\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/4/28/237195.jpeg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/4/28/237195.jpeg\"></div><br></div><br data-reset=\"true\">", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b8b/7_18cUd018bng58kzn303jk1i_bl240p.jpg?type=w660", "//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323bf7/8_78cUd018bngehdp31ray4z6_kj3gfd.jpg?type=w660", "//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/323b48/9_i8cUd018bng1fu6luwyr92to_2ijcxc.jpg?type=w660"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 121717662, "content_num": 6190, "read_num": 36421698, "like_num": 17800}, "update_user": {"ui